          q: "<strong>Read the text.</strong><blockquote>\"The rewilding project began in 2015, when farmers agreed to stop grazing sheep on the hillside. Beavers were reintroduced three years later, and the river, which used to flood the village almost every winter, has not burst its banks since.\"</blockquote>True or false? Justify with words from the text. (a) Beavers were brought back before the farmers stopped grazing sheep. (b) Flooding in the village has decreased.",
