          model: "<strong>Bean There: Worth the Detour?</strong> ★★★★☆<br>Bean There, 21 Hill Road · drinks HK$25-45<br>Tucked behind the bus stop, this tiny café serves the best iced lemon tea in the district. The mango toast is generous, though the seating is cramped and the music is too loud for studying. Verdict: perfect for a quick after-school treat, but go elsewhere if you need a quiet corner.",
